false,"text":"その割にラッキースケベには童貞らしい反応を見せるなどヘタレな面も。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「……だな。自分の、そしてみんなの記憶を取り戻すためにも――よろしくな、柚葉、マハ、アリサ、那月」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"62157"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/fc/fcfdc1bcb81aa7f5f555660a23fddd04bd4c31e2760ff7be71e22c94d5d761c1.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/38/3804ea209d910fe2f084212afeb9fc7a42d7a727dd4a07eba6bd37547a8fbdb2.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_c68696","characterName":"アムール","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"62153","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"240598"}],"egsCharacterIds":["19622"],"vndbCharacterId":"c68696"},"originalCharacterName":"アムール","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"bust":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"92"},"cupSize":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"G"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"155"},"hip":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"84"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"57"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"レオンハルト学院に通う１年生。文武両道、品行方正の優等生。しかしその正体は魔法使いの「快盗」。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"行方不明の母親の行方を探すため、埴生院家に伝わる「都市魔法」を駆使してマハたち快盗団に協力する。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"お嬢様の仮面の下の素顔は真面目だが素直になれない女の子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"分かりやすい反応が可愛くて周囲にイジられがちだが、都市魔法で召喚する都市伝説の威力は強力。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"19622","sourceWorkId":"26616","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"◆快盗コスチューム◆"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"魔女というよりはマジシャンといったコスチュームは、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"彼女がファンだったアニメの人気キャラクターに由来している。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"割りとオタク趣味に理解がある節が伺える。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"レオンハルト学院に通う1年生。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"文武両道、品行方正の優等生。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかしその正体は魔法使いの「快盗」。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"行方不明の母親の行方を探すため、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"埴生院家に伝わる「都市魔法」を駆使してマハたち快盗団に協力する。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"お嬢様の仮面の下の素顔は真面目だが素直になれない女の子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"分かりやすい反応が可愛くて周囲にイジられがちだが、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"都市魔法で召喚する都市伝説の威力は強力。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「やっぱりさっきの話無しっ!!　センパイは怪盗団に入れてやんないっ!!　伝説かどうか知らないけど、今のところただの下着泥棒じゃないのーっ!!」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"62153"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"92 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"19622","sourceWorkId":"26616","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"罩杯（本版本）","value":"g","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"19622","sourceWorkId":"26616","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"155 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"19622","sourceWorkId":"26616","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"84 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"19622","sourceWorkId":"26616","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"57 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"19622","sourceWorkId":"26616","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/82/82f50582d10264cba9c3dbda0ba954598c0aeefd1a83bbcc5815f073ab1220a4.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/be/be0d28415198d4002f3c6ecef6de06f29a1c00643ad33c0812a7d9dc3543710f.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"桜咲千依","creatorId":"vndb:s608","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s608","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s608","name":"藤咲ウサ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:240598:62153:8